; Module 8's test kernel: the primitives of ADR 0009 and, in kasm, the few
; kernel methods the VM's unwinding and signaling protocol needs
; (ensure:, ifCurtailed:-less unwinding through resume:through:, on:do:,
; signal, return:, resume:). The real kernel is 8b's, in Smalltalk; this
; file is what the VM tests run against. Loaded after prelude.kasm.

